<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Haupaix et al. (2018), Inaba et al. (2019) & Lin et al. (2013) somite-prepatterned Agouti signaling, melanocyte gap-junction reaction-diffusion and feather-follicle ring-niche chevrons in galliform plumage stripes — Morphometric validation: 80/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L1138-L1306) now returns 14 measurements. Three are against values the paper publishes: WT 4.0 yellow rows (ref 4), RB 2.0 (ref 2), Fa 6.0 (ref 5-6), with Fa 4 of 6 rows fully pheomelanic and the centre/edge duty ratio 1.88 (paper: > 1). Deductions: the eight Pass 2 measurements compare against mm widths and bead regimes that are not in the papers (reference JSON provenance flags), so 4 of 8 'reference-backed' comparisons are against unsourced numbers (-8); the chevron k error and the lattice-vs-body fraction are self-consistency checks (-4); the lattice y-fraction (0.444) differs from the body pigment-map fraction (0.35) by 0.094, exposing a 9-row vs 80-row quantisation mismatch (-4); no relative-yellow-band-length numbers from Fig. 3C / fig. S6 were digitised (-4)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2018-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes.py L1225–L1305: Eight Pass 2 measurements retained; four reference values (species mm widths, chimera 0.608 mm, bead 0.24 mm) have no published source <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/469bf3c/2018-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes.py#L1225-L1305>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-measurement-5-species-galliform-yellow-stripe-width-correlation-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-measurement-equal-diffusion-d-1-0-negative-control-activator-amplitude-std>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-measurement-exogenous-agouti-bead-dose-1-6-reciprocal-black-stripe-width-w-black>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-measurement-fawn-fa-quail-yellow-feather-rows-per-period>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-measurement-follicle-lattice-y-feather-fraction-vs-body-wide-pigment-map-yellow-fraction>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-measurement-japanese-quail-dorsal-yellow-pheomelanin-stripe-width-w-yellow>,
