    dct:description "Deterministic seed 2018, 12-check `--self-test` (L1312-L1405, ~4 s) covering the four SHA-256 locks, Lean Laws 1-5 as integer/monotonicity instances, PDE, species, chimeras, dose axis, controls, specimen CV, bitwise two-run determinism, lattice row counts, mutants and chevron geometry; the PNG regenerates byte-identically across runs (80cf4ed6...) and the default render takes ~7 s. Deductions: no requirements lock file is vendored for this slot (-4); matplotlib needs MPLCONFIGDIR when the home cache is unwritable and the README does not say so (-2); the GIF is unchanged from Pass 2 and does not show the follicle coupling (-2); `--species` is a dead flag (-2)." ;
